Grammar

    0 $accept: start $end

    1 start: program

    2 program: program unit
    3        | unit

    4 unit: variable_decl
    5     | func_definition

    6 $@1: ε

    7 $@2: ε

    8 func_definition: type_specifier ID LPAREN $@1 param_list RPAREN $@2 compound_statement

    9 $@3: ε

   10 $@4: ε

   11 func_definition: type_specifier ID LPAREN $@3 RPAREN $@4 compound_statement

   12 param_list: param_list COMMA type_specifier ID
   13           | param_list COMMA type_specifier
   14           | type_specifier ID
   15           | type_specifier

   16 $@5: ε

   17 compound_statement: LCURL $@5 statements RCURL

   18 $@6: ε

   19 compound_statement: LCURL $@6 RCURL

   20 variable_decl: type_specifier declaration_list SEMICOLON

   21 type_specifier: INT
   22               | FLOAT
   23               | VOID
   24               | CHAR

   25 declaration_list: declaration_list COMMA ID
   26                 | declaration_list COMMA ID LTHIRD CONST_INT RTHIRD
   27                 | ID
   28                 | ID LTHIRD CONST_INT RTHIRD

   29 statements: statement
